---
{
  "layout": "main",
  "title": "Grokipedia vs Wikipedia: Independent Analysis",
  "description": "Grokipedia Wiki provides independent, objective analysis comparing Grokipedia and Wikipedia. Deep dive into 15+ controversial topics with transparent methodology and data-driven insights.",
  "keywords": "grokipedia vs wikipedia, encyclopedia comparison, independent analysis, AI encyclopedia review, wikipedia alternative, objective encyclopedia analysis",
  "path": "/"
}
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="hero-section relative overflow-hidden py-20 md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <!-- Background Gradient -->
  <div class="hero-bg absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-radial"></div>

  <!-- Decorative Elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="animate-in mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border bg-background/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-primary opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="text-muted-foreground">Latest Analysis</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Heading -->
      <h1 class="heading-1 animate-in delay-100 mb-6">
        <span class="block">Grokipedia vs. Wikipedia</span>
        <span class="text-gradient block mt-2">The Unofficial "PediaWiki" Showdown</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Description -->
      <p class="animate-in delay-200 mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground md:text-xl mb-10">
        Grokipedia Wiki is an independent third-party analysis platform, providing you with the most in-depth and objective comparisons between "GrokiPedia" and "Wikipedia".
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="animate-in delay-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/analysis/" class="btn btn-primary px-8 py-3 text-base shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
          Read Latest Deep Analysis
          <svg class="ml-2 h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/" class="btn btn-outline px-8 py-3 text-base">
          Explore AI Toolbox
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust Indicators -->
      <div class="animate-in delay-400 mt-16 flex flex-col items-center gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-500">
          {{#times 5}}
          <svg class="h-6 w-6 fill-current" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/>
          </svg>
          {{/times}}
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Based on independent, objective analysis principles
        </p>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold">
          <span data-count="5" class="text-primary">5</span>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground ml-2">Comprehensive deep-dive analysis articles</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{> ad-banner size="728x90 Leaderboard"}}

<!-- Features Section -->
<section class="section bg-muted/30">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="heading-2 mb-4">Why Choose Grokipedia Wiki?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Independent analysis, transparent methodology, and objective comparisons
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Features Grid -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Independent Analysis</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          We are not affiliated with Grokipedia or Wikipedia. All analysis is conducted independently.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Transparent Method</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Our analysis methodology is fully transparent and documented for public review.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Data-Driven</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Every conclusion is backed by verifiable data and rigorous comparative analysis.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Deep Analysis</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          We go beyond surface-level comparison to provide detailed, nuanced analysis of each entry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">Regular Updates</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          New comparisons and analysis published weekly. Stay updated with our news center.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6 -->
      <div class="card p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="mb-4 inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2">AI-Powered Tools</h3>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Access our suite of AI tools for comparing and analyzing encyclopedia entries.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{> ad-banner size="728x90 Leaderboard"}}

<!-- Recent Analysis Section -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="heading-2 mb-2">Latest Deep Analysis</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">Explore our most recent comparative studies</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/analysis/" class="link text-base font-medium hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        View all analysis
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Analysis Grid -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Article 1: Launch Controversy -->
      <article class="card overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="h-16 w-16 text-red-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-medium">Platform Analysis</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <time>Oct 29, 2025</time>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2 line-clamp-2">
            The Grokipedia Launch: Controversy & Immediate Criticism
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4 line-clamp-3">
            Examining Grokipedia's October 2025 launch, the immediate controversies, critical reception, and what the launch reveals about AI encyclopedia viability.
          </p>
          <a href="/analysis/launch-controversy.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Read full analysis
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 2: Bias & Accuracy -->
      <article class="card overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500/20 to-orange-500/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="h-16 w-16 text-yellow-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-yellow-100 dark:bg-yellow-900/30 text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-medium">Accuracy Analysis</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <time>Oct 28, 2025</time>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2 line-clamp-2">
            Bias & Accuracy: The Battle for Neutrality
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4 line-clamp-3">
            Both platforms face bias allegations in opposite directions. Analyzing the evidence, root causes, and evaluating accuracy concerns including AI hallucinations.
          </p>
          <a href="/analysis/bias-accuracy.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Read full analysis
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Article 3: Editorial Transparency -->
      <article class="card overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
        <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/20 to-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="h-16 w-16 text-blue-500/40" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6">
          <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-medium">Editorial Analysis</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <time>Oct 28, 2025</time>
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3 mb-2 line-clamp-2">
            Editorial Process & Transparency Comparison
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4 line-clamp-3">
            Comparing editorial processes and transparency standards. How does each platform maintain content quality, accountability, and trust?
          </p>
          <a href="/analysis/editorial-transparency.html" class="link text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
